{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44817","headline":"送坚上人归杭州天竺寺 · 清江","name":"送坚上人归杭州天竺寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年劳负笈，经论化中朝。\n流水知乡近，和风惜别遥。\n云山零夜雨，花岸上春潮。\n归卧南天竺，禅心更寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清江","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}